[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 661.35, "timestamp": "00:11:01", "text": "這算是PNG格式的模特兒嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 664.31, "timestamp": "00:11:04", "text": "嚴格來說，可以算是PNG格式的模特，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 668.47, "timestamp": "00:11:08", "text": "我還沒有這個模特閉眼、微笑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 670.79, "timestamp": "00:11:10", "text": "或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 675.19, "timestamp": "00:11:15", "text": "閉眼的圖片，所以它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 678.63, "timestamp": "00:11:18", "text": "只是一個靜態的IC PNG圖片。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 683.269, "timestamp": "00:11:23", "text": "是的，目前是這樣。希望將來我能為這個模型實現即時"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 687.99, "timestamp": "00:11:27", "text": "2D 渲染。嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 692.63, "timestamp": "00:11:32", "text": "是的，你會看到它動起來。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 695.75, "timestamp": "00:11:35", "text": "終於。所以，天知道要花多久時間"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 699.19, "timestamp": "00:11:39", "text": "，但是，只要我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 703.59, "timestamp": "00:11:43", "text": "有錢，我就可以盡快完成。但是，是的，這還得等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 707.19, "timestamp": "00:11:47", "text": "一段時間，很長一段時間"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 709.35, "timestamp": "00:11:49", "text": "。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 712.55, "timestamp": "00:11:52", "text": "所以，嗯，今天我在上課的時候做了一些新的東西，嗯，我已經"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 718.79, "timestamp": "00:11:58", "text": "準備好了一個系統等等，我的一個好朋友，嗯，你做"}]